            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜美股周五個別發展 納指及費城半導體指數顯著造好\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c460bdd15af209a9761bf73d53273a284636b311b82e2c7142b9da3e93fc486b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜美股周五個別發展 納指及費城半導體指數顯著造好</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至2026年11月6日下午5時30分，美股三大指數表現分歧，道指跌237.33點至51285.73點，納指升264.428點至24314.997點，標普500升23.13點至7376.86點。費城半導體指數急升4.207%。歐洲主要股市則全線向下，倫敦富時100、米蘭MIB及蘇黎世SMI均錄得跌幅。</p></div>",
